### Environment Variables for HTTP Client
### Use these variables in your .http files by referencing {{variable_name}}

### Development Environment
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json

### Sample IDs (replace with actual IDs from your database)
@user_id = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
@asset_id_btc = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
@asset_id_eth = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439013
@asset_id_ada = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439014
@portfolio_id = 507f1f77bcf86cd799439015

### Sample User Data
@test_email = test@mycrypto.com
@test_name = Test User
@test_password = securePassword123

### Sample Asset Data
@btc_symbol = BTC
@eth_symbol = ETH
@ada_symbol = ADA

### Sample Prices
@btc_price = 45000.00
@eth_price = 3000.00
@ada_price = 0.50

### Pagination
@skip = 0
@limit = 10
